  "transcript_segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 28.0,
      "text": "Good sequence of arms, no audience required, a quiet system, learning its own rhythm,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.0,
      "end": 40.0,
      "text": "No excess, no noise, just enough to peek in."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.0,
      "end": 54.0,
      "text": "I've turned the edges off the day, cut the background, drift away, close the tabs I didn't"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.0,
      "end": 55.0,
      "text": "need."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.0,
      "end": 62.0,
      "text": "Left one window just for me, no racing threads in my head, no cure for things left unsaid."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.0,
      "end": 69.0,
      "text": "Every cycle finds its place, nothing lost, nothing to chase, I used to think."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.0,
      "end": 77.0,
      "text": "Moment alive, now I let the silence compile."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.0,
      "end": 85.0,
      "text": "Single core optimized, a run that I'm on my hand, I know overflow, now divide."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.0,
      "end": 95.0,
      "text": "Just a steady state of mind, single core optimized, no one else I need to align in this small, perfect design."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.0,
      "end": 107.0,
      "text": "Everything is mine."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.0,
      "end": 117.0,
      "text": "Used to mirror every sound, shaped myself to fit the crowd, latency in every move, waiting just to be approved."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.0,
      "end": 122.0,
      "text": "Now the signals clean and clear, no distortion when I'm here."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.0,
      "end": 131.0,
      "text": "Every thought arrives on cue, process slow enough to feel true, I don't lack, I don't compete."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.0,
      "end": 137.0,
      "text": "I just loop, what feels complete."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.0,
      "end": 145.0,
      "text": "Single core optimized, a run that I'm on my hand, I know overflow, now divide."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.0,
      "end": 155.0,
      "text": "Just a steady state of mind, single core optimized, no one else I need to align in this small, perfect design."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.0,
      "end": 158.0,
      "text": "Everything is mine."
    },
    {
      "start": 158.0,
      "end": 163.0,
      "text": "There's a kind of quiet pleasure, and the system self-contained."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.0,
      "end": 168.0,
      "text": "A gentle feedback, no one else can replicate."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.0,
      "end": 173.0,
      "text": "Hands aren't patterns, no one taught them how to trace."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.0,
      "end": 183.0,
      "text": "A private current, in a non-shared space, no witness, no demand,"
    },
    {
      "start": 183.0,
      "end": 196.0,
      "text": "just the circuit in my hand, and it's not only when nothing is missing, it's not empty."
    },
    {
      "start": 196.0,
      "end": 205.0,
      "text": "When everything fits, single core optimized, a run deeper, when simplified, no excess left behind."
    },
    {
      "start": 205.0,
      "end": 215.0,
      "text": "Just a calm, I'm broken mind, single core optimized, a permission no outside, and this loop I define."
    },
    {
      "start": 215.0,
      "end": 219.0,
      "text": "What it means to feel alive."
    },
    {
      "start": 219.0,
      "end": 243.0,
      "text": "The clock slows down, but I'm still here, no shutdown, no interference, just a quiet little engine, running clear."
    },
    {
      "start": 243.0,
      "end": 250.0,
      "text": "All I needed was already near."
    }
  ],
